      "gloss": "somersault, acrobatic flip",
      "comment": "Singular nominative and genitive. Morgan–Owens lists the plural <strong lang=\"la\">saltūs cernuī</strong>; the singular is inflected here from that expression. These words distinguish turning an object over from a bodily flip; they do not imply that a coin toss, switch operation, cartwheel and airborne backflip all have the same exact technical name."
